# Large CAD/mesh binaries. Kept out of git deliberately: the STEP assembly is
# 111 MB (over GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file limit, so a push containing it is
# rejected outright) and the MuJoCo STL assets add another 97 MB, which would
# grow this repo from 8 MB to ~210 MB permanently - undoing that needs a
# history rewrite. Track them with git-lfs if they need to be versioned.
*.stp
*.STP
*.rar
src/tap_sim/model/assets/*.stl
src/tap_sim/model/assets/*.STL
firmware_esp32/include/tap_hw/WifiSecrets.hpp
